        {
          "name": "Flying Leap",
          "type": "ex",
          "description": "A forgiven deceit can perform a special kind of pounce attack by flying into combat. When a forgiven deceit charges, it can make a DC 20 Fly check to fly into the air and land next to his enemies. If he makes the Fly check, he can follow up with four wing attacks against foes in reach, but cannot make a bite attack.",
